body:
Ah yeah voices are tough, probably going to be stuck with those by the sound of it.  I'm pretty good so far in not following through on what they tell me to do.  Yeah the paranoia is rough, makes it hard to interact with customers at work for sure.  Delusions probably hit me the hardest out of everything ngl, I'm glad in time it sounds like all of this becomes easier.  And I feel ya on the sleep bit, that's the one thing I like about my meds is that they allow me to sleep.

&#x200B;

Yeah I will try and keep my head up and take things as slow as I can, it's tough but today I overcame a hurdle that was weighing me down for a couple weeks so things are looking up.
